├────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┤
│    WebXR / VisionOS Canvas     │      Scene Graph Store          │    Real-Time Sync Pipelines   │
│  - R3F Canvas & WebXR Manager  │  - Zustand + Temporal Engine    │  - Supabase Realtime CDC      │
│  - 6DOF Controller & Gestures  │  - Optimistic Transforms        │  - Agent SSE Streaming Client │
│  - PBR Material & Light Rig    │  - Entity Locking & Guardrails  │  - Progressive Asset Loader   │
